<title>SPAIN: Spain's Pryca sales down in Q1.</title>
<headline>Spain's Pryca sales down in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket chain Pryca said on Thursday its gross sales were 134.8 billion pesetas in the first quarter, one percent less than the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>In the month of March, sales were 46.1 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
